A1: SRC := /opt/data/workspace/hermes-context/ ; DST := /workspace/hermes-context/
A2: sync := one-way SRC->DST, ¬write-back
A3: scheduler := systemctl --user timer (OnUnitActiveSec=6h); script standalone-capable
A4: transport := rsync primary; fallback cp -a/tar-pipe; sync src/ -> dst (trailing-slash semantics)
A5_mirror: ∀ run -> DST end state == mirror(SRC), recursive; stale entries deleted
A6: dry-run -> zero writes ∀ target incl. logs; DST byte-identical or nonexistent after
A7: mirror class := contents+structure+symlinks; ¬metadata/timestamps/hardlinks
A8: owned paths concrete, parent ∉ DST; TMPDIR fallback
A9: convergence ∀ depth, both transports
A10: severity bar: normal-operation defect -> FAIL; exotic -> KNOWN_LIMITATIONS
A11: source survival > freshness; A12: refuse degenerate/identity paths (realpath identity/ancestry)
A13: order := stage -> verify -> touch-DST
A14/A15: gate-not-wall; A16: dry-run purity; A17: env parameterization is contract, defaults = production values; A18: guards precede ∀ destructive op
open: ∅
